spell.forge2k.specialClone2k.description:
{Advanced Double Clone}

Creates 2 duplicates of the selected unit stack. The image is dispelled if it is attacked.
Clones creatures of levels 1-6.

{Basic Double Clone}

Creates 2 duplicates of the selected unit stack. The image is dispelled if it is attacked.
Clones creatures of levels 1-5.

{Expert Double Clone}

Creates 2 duplicates of the selected unit stack. The image is dispelled if it is attacked.
Clones creatures of any level.

{Double Clone}

Creates 2 duplicates of the selected unit stack. The image is dispelled if it is attacked.
Clones creatures of levels 1-5.
